<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>The Grid Unplugged — Panamera Media Co</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,Inter,Helvetica,Arial;background:#fff;color:#0a0a0a}
.breaking{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:8px 16px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px}
header{border-bottom:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:10}
.topbar{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-size:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 24px 48px}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#38B6FF;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px}
.section-label{margin:48px 0 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.5}
.section-title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:0.9;margin-bottom:12px}
.pink{color:#FF2E93}.blue{color:#38B6FF}.yellow{color:#FFD60A}
.subtitle{font-size:14px;opacity:0.6;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:24px;max-width:640px}
.meta-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:24px 0}
.meta-box{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px}
.meta-box small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:4px}
.meta-box div{font-weight:800;font-size:13px}
.hero{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f0e6;margin:24px 0}
.hero img{width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain;display:block;background:#f5f0e6}
.article{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:720px}
.article p{margin-bottom:16px}
.article h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:900;margin:28px 0 12px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;margin:32px 0}
.grid img{width:100%;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;display:block;background:#111;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover}
footer{border-top:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;padding:24px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5;margin-top:48px}
.back{display:inline-flex;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:24px}
@media(max-width:800px){.section-title{font-size:32px}.meta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="breaking">PANAMERA MEDIA CO • HAMPTONS 2026 • WORLD PREMIERE</div>
<header><div class="topbar"><a class="logo" href="/">PANAMERA MEDIA CO</a><div style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5">PANAMERAMEDIA.COM</div></div></header>
<div class="container">
<a class="back" href="/">← BACK TO HOME</a>
<div class="section-label">34TH HAMPTONS INTERNATIONAL FILM FESTIVAL • AIR, LAND & SEA</div>
<div><span class="badge">WORLD PREMIERE • DOCUMENTARY</span></div>
<div class="section-title"><span class="pink">THE</span> <span class="blue">GRID</span> <span class="yellow">UNPLUGGED</span></div>
<div class="subtitle">From director Rick Cutter, exec produced by Ed Begley Jr. — starts with electric cars and ends on a failing power grid.</div>
<div class="meta-grid">
  <div class="meta-box"><small>DIRECTOR</small><div>Rick Cutter</div></div>
  <div class="meta-box"><small>EXECUTIVE PRODUCER</small><div>Ed Begley Jr.</div></div>
  <div class="meta-box"><small>RUN TIME</small><div>76 min</div></div>
</div>
<div class="hero"><img src="/the-grid-unplugged-poster.png" alt="The Grid Unplugged" /></div>
<div class="article">
  <h3>About the Film</h3>
  <p><strong>The Grid Unplugged</strong> is the debut feature from Rick Cutter, President of non-profit August Palm Creative. Using California's wildfires as a gateway, it investigates the growing strain on aging power grids worldwide.</p>
  <p>Balancing alarming risks with promising solutions, the film explores whether humanity can fix the grid faster than we're breaking it.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid">
  <img src="/the-grid-unplugged-still-1.png" alt="" />
  <img src="/the-grid-unplugged-still-2.png" alt="" />
</div>
<footer>PANAMERA MEDIA CO © 2026</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
